OL,3,GNEWSATrackside fire blocks railway line
OL,4,
OL,5,FA fire next to a railway track in the
OL,6,FWest Midlands has blocked the line
OL,7,Fbetween Birmingham International and
OL,8,FCoventry.
OL,10,FThe fire, in the Canley area, would
OL,11,Fcause major disruption until at least
OL,12,F19:15 BST on Monday, National Rail
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FPassengers travelling between Coventry
OL,16,Fand Birmingham International face
OL,17,Fservices that could be cancelled,
OL,18,Frevised or delayed by up to 30 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
